src/analysis/design/
--------------------

`src/analysis/design/` is a refactor of the ESM cookbook binder-design
tutorial, `cookbook/tutorials/binder_design.py` in
https://github.com/Biohub/esm at commit ba4d712. The upstream file is a single
1322-line script. Here it is split along its own section boundaries into
modules; the code itself was moved verbatim. Nothing was renamed, no signature
was changed, and no numerical behaviour was altered.
`tests/test_design_port.py` checks this by comparing each ported definition's
syntax tree against the upstream blob and by running every CPU-reachable
function in both.

`get_base_image` in `src/analysis/modal_app.py` is verbatim from the same
upstream file, lines 1182-1231.

